  "body": "Seen in v0.26.0:\n- Each failed Send leaves a bubble with a red error, and the same error repeats in a banner. There is no Retry and no Clear chat, and the history mixes providers.\n- The prompt is one line. Long prompts need multi-line input (Enter sends, Shift+Enter adds a line).\n- \"Viewport screenshot capture is unavailable.\" is shown all the time and Attach screenshot is disabled, with no reason given.\n- No empty state: what the assistant can do, two or three example prompts, what is sent to the provider (privacy), and that cloud providers cost API credits.\n\nDone means: each item above is fixed and pinned by a UI structural test.\n\nUser validation (reporter, 2026-11-23): before this merges, the reporter (mkinney) hand-tests a build of the PR in the desktop app and confirms it is usable. The PR stays a draft until that confirmation is on the PR.\n",
